mlxflow 0.8
1. Template    "Research: how did our support ticket themes change this
               year?"
2. Draft       Qwen3 8B; "Break into 3–6 research questions, one per line"
3. Split       by=lines   text -> [text]
4. <each execute_step>   [text] -> [text]
     1. <list react_agent>   (input:1)   # entry 41's block, pasted in
          1. Read Index               library.index
          2. Think        (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; tools: search, calculate, final; max_visits=8; on_budget=final
             -> { search: call 3 | calculate: call 5 | final: resume }
          3. Embed                    BGE-M3
          4. Retrieve     (1,3)       top_k=5
             resume
          5. Calculate
             resume
5. Merge       Qwen3 8B; "Combine into one report; note gaps"
6. Gate        Ministral 3B; "Gaps that need another pass? tags: replan,
               done"; max_visits=2; on_budget=done
   -> { replan: 2 | done: 7 }
7. Save Text   report.md
